<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIX FOR THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIX FOR THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for Thursday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,598.60 (1,596.50)	CHF  1,106.60 (1,108.70)</p>
<p>    DEM    956.67 (957.13)	  GBP  2,626.30 (2,624.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    135.96 (136.06)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>Banks bought  $22.93 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold    $16.58 million</p>
<p>Total turover $39.51 million ($45.17 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
